		(uuid "cb635f95-4e31-47b4-92eb-518d319ed623")
	)
	(text "Camera: 24-pin ESP32-CAM style FPC (J12), 8-bit DVP to U13. DOVDD from VSENS-3V3; AVDD 2.8 V and DVDD 1.2 V\nfrom ME6211 LDOs. CAM-RESET from U28 PB9 (R244 holds it in reset), CAM-PWDN from U13 PC10.\nFirmware: XCLK, SCCB, PWDN and RESET low or hi-Z while VSENS-3V3 is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.138 280.416 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1f061ac4-6fea-4324-a770-40ae87596c49")
	)
	(text "Compatible with STDC14 (1.27mm pitch)\n\nPin 11 (GNDDetect) can detect\nJTAG cable presence using a 100k\npull-up plus a spare GPIO\n\nThe watchdog shuts off motors when not petted\nJTAG, SWD, BOOT0 do NOT disable the watchdog\nSo, using JTAG/SWD/flash-over-UART stops motors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "684d6a7d-c5ed-4b75-b45d-a544822f7292")
	)
	(text "TTL-234X-3V3 cable (0.1\" pitch): 1 GND, 4 TXD -> STM32-RX,\n5 RXD <- STM32-TX, 2 CTS#, 3 VCC, 6 RTS# not connected\n\nAll debug, spare headers are VERTICAL (not right angle)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e37740c-9b46-4fe7-bea5-515dde47faca")
	)
	(text "Short BOOT0 to VMCU-3V3 to load firmware via USB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 163.83 184.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b714eb57-1750-4647-858e-52b8124022c9")
	)
	(text "Carpet echo: OPA3 non-inverting AC amplifier\n(out PE7 = OPA3_OUT1, in- PB2, in+ PB13),\nthen an envelope detector into PA1 (ADC).\nGain 11, set on the bench."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.82 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d8975a64-0a25-45f0-848d-54cc54708e16")
	)
	(text "U28 CH32L103: link to U13 on USART2 (PA2/PA3),\nalso its bootloader port: U13 sets MCU2-BOOT\n(BOOT0) high and pulses MCU2-NRST to flash it.\nPA13/PA14 (SWDIO/SWCLK) free for a WCH-LinkE.\nUSB_VBUS_SENSE is digital (R188/R189: ~3.4 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 149.352 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f9de9a77-50e6-4a14-b8e0-722069309940")
	)
